  <data name="Settings.About.Update.Unavailable" xml:space="preserve"><value>This copy of the app cannot update itself. Update it the way you installed it, for example with winget, Scoop or Chocolatey, or download the latest version from GitHub. An installation for all users can only update itself while the app runs as administrator.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings.About.Repository.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Source Code on GitHub</value></data>
  <data name="Settings.About.Repository.Desc" xml:space="preserve"><value>FluentTaskScheduler is open source. See how it is made and get new releases.</value></data>
  <data name="Settings.About.Issue.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Report a Problem</value></data>
